B.NI=new A.hK("Spacing drill: 20 fed balls, setting up so contact is a full arm\u2019s reach plus racket from your body \u2014 no crowding.","Soft-arm drill: 20 fed balls at 70% pace, keeping a relaxed bend in the elbow at contact.")
B.NN=new A.hK("Stay-tall drill: 20 fed balls, pushing up out of your legs as you swing instead of sinking.","Wide-base drill: 20 fed balls from a stance a little wider than your shoulders, sitting into your legs before each swing.")
B.NK=new A.hK("Low-to-high drill: start the racket below the ball, finish over your opposite shoulder. 20 fed balls aiming 1 m over the net.","Through-the-ball drill: 20 fed balls driven deep at a target 2 m inside the baseline, swinging forward toward it.")
B.NM=new A.hK("Tray drill: carry the ball forward on the strings as if on a tray. 20 fed slices that stay low and land deep.","High-to-low drill: start the racket above the ball and finish forward and low. 20 fed slices.")
B.NH=new A.hK("\u201cOne-two\u201d drill: say \u201cone\u201d on the take-back and \u201ctwo\u201d on the swing. 20 fed balls at a steady rhythm.","Early-prep drill: turn and take the racket back the moment the ball leaves the feeder\u2019s hand. 20 fed balls.")
B.NG=new A.hK("Footwork drill: 20 fed balls, moving so every contact is between waist and chest \u2014 never down by your knees.","Back-up drill: 20 high fed balls, taking two quick steps back so each one drops to chest height before you hit.")
B.NF=new A.hK("Cone drill: place a cone a step in front of your front foot and make contact level with it. 20 fed balls.","Let-it-come drill: 20 fed balls, making contact just ahead of your front hip instead of reaching for it.")
B.NL=new A.hK("Loose-and-fast drill: 10 quick, relaxed shadow swings, then 20 fed balls at 80% effort with a grip pressure of 3 out of 10.",null)
B.NP=new A.hK(null,"Slow-motion drill: 10 slow shadow swings along a fence line, then 20 fed balls at half pace keeping that same path.")
B.NO=new A.hK(null,"Watch-the-contact drill: 20 fed balls, keeping your eyes on the contact spot for a beat after the ball has gone.")
B.NJ=new A.hK("Hold-the-finish drill: 20 fed balls, freezing for two seconds with the racket over your opposite shoulder.","Extend-to-target drill: 20 fed balls, reaching the racket toward your target before letting it finish.")
B.Wi=new A.bI(B.Xo,[B.NI,B.NN,B.NK,B.NM,B.NH,B.NG,B.NF,B.NL,B.NP,B.NO,B.NJ],A.af("bI<l,hK>"))
