B.Ge=new A.hb("You\u2019re meeting the ball a bit low \u2014 move your feet so it\u2019s around waist height when you hit.","You\u2019re meeting the ball very low \u2014 set your feet earlier and take it between waist and chest.","You\u2019re meeting the ball a bit high \u2014 step back to let it drop, or move in to take it earlier.","You\u2019re meeting the ball very high \u2014 step back so it drops into your waist-to-chest zone, or take it earlier on the rise.","Good contact height \u2014 right in your strike zone.")
B.Gn=new A.hb("Looks like you\u2019re hitting a bit late \u2014 meet the ball a little further in front of you.","Looks like you\u2019re hitting late, beside your body \u2014 start the swing earlier and meet the ball out in front.","Looks like you\u2019re reaching a bit far in front \u2014 let the ball come to you a little more.","Looks like you\u2019re reaching well out in front \u2014 let the ball come closer before you hit.","Nice contact point out in front \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gm=new A.hb("Looks like your swing is a bit slow \u2014 stay loose and let the racket speed up through contact.","Looks like your swing speed is low \u2014 relax your grip and swing through the ball, not at it.",null,null,"Good racket-hand speed \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gl=new A.hb(null,null,"Looks like your racket path wobbles a bit through contact \u2014 aim for one smooth line.","Looks like your racket path wanders through contact \u2014 slow down and groove one smooth swing.","Smooth, clean swing path \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gj=new A.hb(null,null,"Your head moves a little during the swing \u2014 keep it still and watch the contact point.","Your head moves a lot during the swing \u2014 keep it still until after you hit.","Nice steady head \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gg=new A.hb("Finish a little higher \u2014 let the racket come up over your shoulder.","Your swing stops low \u2014 follow through all the way up over your opposite shoulder.","Your finish is a bit high \u2014 extend forward toward your target before the racket comes up.","Your finish shoots straight up \u2014 drive forward through the ball before you finish.","Full, complete finish \u2014 keep it up.")
